---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base title="Bishal Hona">
  <section class="hero shell">
    <p class="label hero__kicker">Infrastructure for LLM systems</p>

    <h1 class="serif hero__title">
      Backend that stays calm<br />when things break.
    </h1>

    <p class="hero__lede measure">
      I'm Bishal Hona, a backend engineer. I build the parts of AI products that
      live between the model and the person using it. The background jobs, the
      memory that has to survive across sessions, the streaming, the auth. The
      stuff that's invisible when it works.
    </p>

    <p class="hero__ai serif">
      Plenty of AI products look great in a demo. I build the part that keeps
      them working once real people are using them.
    </p>

    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="cta" href="/work">
        <span>See how I built Nura</span>
        <span class="cta__arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cta cta--ghost" href="/writing">Read the writing</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell focus">
    <hr class="hr" />
    <dl class="focus__grid">
      <div class="focus__item">
        <dt class="label">01 · Isolated queues</dt>
        <dd>I run the background AI jobs in separate queues, so if one kind of task breaks it can't drag the rest down with it. And if a job gets stuck partway, a recovery process picks it back up on its own instead of letting it disappear.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="focus__item">
        <dt class="label">02 · Memory that lasts</dt>
        <dd>I build memory that carries from one session to the next. I keep a tight cap on how much of it goes to the model at once, and I record which context produced a given response so I can go back and check.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="focus__item">
        <dt class="label">03 · Streaming responses</dt>
        <dd>Responses stream in as the model writes them, so nobody sits watching a blank screen while they wait for the whole answer to land.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="focus__item">
        <dt class="label">04 · Session security</dt>
        <dd>Sessions rotate on their own. If a stolen session token ever gets reused, I log every one of that user's sessions out right away.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 2rem + 6vw, 7rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 3vw, 4rem);
  }
  .hero__kicker { margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
  .hero__title {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .hero__lede {
    margin-top: clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2vw, 2.4rem);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--graphite);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .hero__ai {
    margin-top: clamp(1.8rem, 1.2rem + 2vw, 2.8rem);
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--ink);
    max-width: 46ch;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .hero__actions {
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2vw, 3rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6em;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--paper);
    background: var(--ink);
    padding: 0.85em 1.3em;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    transition: background 200ms var(--ease), color 200ms var(--ease);
  }
  .cta__arr { transition: transform 220ms var(--ease); }
  .cta:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); }
  .cta:hover .cta__arr { transform: translateX(4px); }
  .cta--ghost {
    color: var(--graphite);
    background: transparent;
    border-color: var(--mist);
  }
  .cta--ghost:hover { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--graphite); }

  .focus { padding-top: clamp(3rem, 2rem + 4vw, 5rem); }
  .focus__grid {
    margin-top: clamp(1.6rem, 1rem + 2vw, 2.6rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 3vw, 3.5rem);
  }
  .focus__item dt { margin-bottom: 0.7rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .focus__item dd { color: var(--graphite); font-size: var(--step-0); line-height: 1.55; }

  @media (max-width: 46rem) {
    .focus__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.8rem; }
    .hero__title { max-width: none; }
  }
</style>
